<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 81,950T of wheat bran pellet.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 81,950T of wheat bran pellet.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two South Korean buyer groups, the Korea Feed Association in Pusan and the Big Feed Mills, jointly bought a total of 81,950 tonnes of Indonesian wheat bran pellet from Bogasari, traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the amounts arriving in Inchon may change after the deal due to the buyers' demand.</p>
<p>Premium for port rotation was set at $1.5 a tonne.</p>
<p>Details of purchases are as follows:</p>
<p> TONNE   ETA	ARRIVAL PORT    PRICE(won per kg, C&amp;F)</p>
<p> 14,000  July 20  Inchon	    136</p>
<p> 10,000  Aug 20   Inchon	    136</p>
<p> 10,000  Sep 20   Inchon	    136</p>
<p> 12,000  July 15  Kunsan/Ulsan    137.30</p>
<p> 16,950  Aug 15   Kunsan/Ulsan    137.30</p>
<p> 19,000  Sep 15   Kunsan/Ulsan    137.30</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
